Hi all,

I'm happy to share that starting with the April 4, 2025 paycheck, employees with an approved hybrid arrangement will receive a connectivity stipend of $40 per month to help with home internet and phone costs.

A few details:

- It's paid automatically. You don't need to apply or send receipts.
- It is taxable, so it will show up on your pay stub as "CONNECT STIP" and be included in your W-2.
- On-site employees are not eligible.

We've also updated the Hybrid Work Policy (now version 1.1) with a couple of clarifications people have asked for:

- You need to have been with us at least 90 days before requesting hybrid work.
- Hybrid employees are in the office at least two days per week.
- If business needs change, the Credit Union can end a hybrid arrangement with two weeks' notice.

As always, your HR Business Partner is happy to talk through any questions.

Renata

